sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SA as StrategyAgent
    participant Bus as MessageBus
    participant RA as RiskAgent
    participant PA as PortfolioAgent
    participant EA as ExecutionAgent
    participant PB as PaperBroker
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant TUI as Dashboard

    SA->>Bus: SIGNAL {symbol, weight, dir}
    Bus->>RA: deliver SIGNAL
    RA->>RA: check pos-limit, daily-loss, kill-switch
    RA->>Bus: APPROVED (or RISK_ALERT)
    Bus->>PA: deliver APPROVED
    PA->>PA: size: V_target = NAV * w
    PA->>Bus: ORDER_NEW
    Bus->>EA: deliver ORDER_NEW
    EA->>EA: kill-switch / naked-short / CIO HALT guards
    EA->>PB: execute(order)
    PB->>PB: AC impact F = P + d*(I_perm + I_temp) + nu
    PB->>EA: fill {price, qty, commission, slippage}
    EA->>DB: BEGIN TXN: insert fill, update order, update position, adjust cash
    EA->>Bus: ORDER_FILL
    Bus->>PA: deliver ORDER_FILL
    Bus->>TUI: deliver ORDER_FILL
    TUI-->>TUI: refresh fills + NAV panels
